@title Parts window: Import on a Rittal part opens the PARTcommunity hand-off with its steps
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
@area Parts
# Where the user finds it: Parts window > select a Rittal part > Import.
user_catalog qa/fixtures/rittal-parts.json
fresh
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Parts
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
text 1500510
wait 12
key Down
wait 8
shot part-selected
click_text Import
wait 15
expect "PARTcommunity"
shot waiting-with-steps
